{"reviewId": "3159831_8aUcjHrUd", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "那如何用这个来理解受到战争影响的石油价格呢。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "14161-14211", "abstract": "所以不能用当期供需来解释价格长期波动的原因，这是我们一贯的观点，能源价格的波动是一个长期累积的结果。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "3159831_8aUcjHrUd", "userVid": 3159831, "topics": [], "createTime": 1785129088, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 3159831, "name": "Hugo.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-T1glDDutd0eA3Ny1RaiHM10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Hugo.", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "有空就多看点书", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "正直善良有阅读量", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 279647851, "name": "momo", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLCiaMRsYsk5mowU3ibXTsezD6d155y1UU50xJOULAxKLpOpVyQkMtRa1x8MtyRKq7MCKTqYSfCxjiauw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "momo", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "3159831_8aUcjHrUd", "content": "战争对石油价格的冲击正是这种“短期供给冲击＋长期惯性”叠加的典型例子​​：\n• ​​供给端​​：战争导致关键产区减产或运输受阻，瞬时减少全球供给，按照供需曲线会立刻抬高价格；\n• ​​预期端​​：地缘冲突提高了对未来供给中断的担忧，投资者提前买入期货或避险资产，进一步推高价格；\n• ​​金融端​​：石油以美元计价，战争引发的避险情绪往往推高美元、压低其他资产价格，石油期货的金融属性放大了波动；\n• ​​惯性与滞后​​：即使战争在短期内解决，供应链恢复也需要时间，价格往往在高位震荡较长时间，这正是“长期累积结果”的体现④。\n因此，​​战争确实能解释油价在短期内的急升​​，但若要说明“长期累积”的原因，还需要同时看到：\n• 前期供需失衡、效率递减、替代能源进度慢等基本面因素；\n• 石油金融化和全球流动性环境；\n• 供应链重建速度与技术替代的滞后。", "commentId": "3159831_8aUcjHrUd_c266170854_8bhPFs4xd", "userVid": 266170854, "createTime": 1786471544, "author": {"userVid": 266170854, "name": "tt", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epIE3HlbFMDwysxH12XnQGovicSYZ2iaxrbE875JHDyF6c40akiaAG3IicuFqkbTVVv4kUpSbaLriaKEG5fic9TF40ME9JfbnibrNGZvBpiagkDpX6oRg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "tt", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1790150902}